ksnip-pyqt6-ocr (0.1.4-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Route the core table/Markdown OCR backend through the managed launcher.
  * Add KSNIP_OCR_MODE=markdown/html support to the standalone runner.
  * Refresh the managed launcher when the plugin configuration is applied,
    so existing environments pick up the new runner without a reinstall.

